      "source": "<a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a> implementations to invoke against the\nannotated element.",
      "translation": "对已注解元素调用的 `<a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\"><code>ReflectiveProcessor</code></a>` 实现。",
