    {
      "source": "Alias for <a href=\"#processors()\"><code>processors()</code></a>.",
      "translation": "`<a href=\"#processors()\">`<code>processors()</code></a>` 的别名。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "When present, either directly or as a meta-annotation, this annotation\ntriggers the configured <a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\">processors</a> against\nthe annotated element. By default, a reflection hint is registered for the\nannotated element so that it can be discovered and invoked if necessary.",
      "translation": "当存在时，无论是直接存在还是作为元注解，此注解会触发配置的<a href=\"ReflectiveProcessor.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.aot.hint.annotation\">processors</a>针对已注解的元素。默认情况下，会为已注解的元素注册一个反射提示，以便在必要时发现并调用它。",
      "count": 2
    },
